    "description": "Level 3: a realistic 18-node floor - two rack rows, a cross aisle, a dock lane with a capacity-1 segment, three stations with 1/2/1 docks, and four capacity-2 units starting at charge/park nodes. Eleven pods in three waves with mixed destinations. This is the integration case: batching, dock discipline, aisle contention and assignment all bind at once, and a driver that only does one of them well loses points on the others."
